On utilise le paramètre `responses` dans les décorateurs de route FastAPI :

```python
from fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException, status
from pydantic import BaseModel

class ErrorMessage(BaseModel):
    detail: str

app = FastAPI()

@app.get(
    "/items/{id}",
    responses={
        404: {"model": ErrorMessage, "description": "Item non trouvé"},
        403: {"model": ErrorMessage, "description": "Droits insuffisants"}
    }
)
async def read_item(id: str):
    raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail="Item inconnu")
```
